Architecture:
 A) Upload Manager Task: prio 5, core 1. Raw HTTP write loop + fairness.
 B) HTTP Server Task: prio 3, core 0. Handles /, /status, /start, /abort.
 C) Prefetch Task (optional): prio 2, core 1. Fills fixed ring buffer.
 D) Monitor Task: prio 1, core 0. Wi-Fi reconnect/watchdog.
Data flow: SD file -> optional ring -> upload loop -> remote server.
Fairness: chunked writes, zero-write delay, taskYIELD, 2ms timeslice delay.

Serial commands:
  help   -> print commands
  start  -> start upload
  abort  -> abort upload
  reset_upload_state -> clear persisted uploaded state and re-queue test files
  recover_sd -> force SD recover routine
  bookkeeping -> print uploaded/outstanding/queue counters
  test_reachability_probe -> run reachability probe self test
  test_retry_policy -> run retry-policy self test
  test_server_contract -> run server-contract self test
  test_uploaded_state_bookkeeping -> run uploaded-state bookkeeping self test
  test_recover_sd -> run SD recover self test
  test_reset_upload_state -> run reset-upload-state self test
  status -> print current upload stats
  reset  -> reboot MCU
test_reachability_probe PASS
